    "detailed_description": "<h1>Demo Announcement!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Greetings all! We are so excited to bring you the Demo of Odin's Defense! This is just a little taste of what we have in store before we release the full game later this year. This little adventure takes place before the events of Odin's Defense. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Valkyrie is missing! Gather your allies and rescue her before it's too late!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <br>Odin\u2019s Defense is a twist on the traditional Tower Defense genre. Equip your towers with powerful items to create unique effects during each wave. Immerse yourself in the story, battle spiders, slimes, skellies and more. This demo features a short prequel to the main story of Odin's Defense coming soon!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Demo Features:</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Single player tower defense inspired by Norse mythology. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Traverse 3 different biomes on this prequel quest to rescue Valkyrie!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 8 available Towers all with unique abilities. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Tons of enemies to challenge your skills and test your wits. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- A variety of items for you to collect and use in creative ways. </p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a quest to defeat Fenrir. Travel distant lands, flanked by your allies, and take your rightful place by Odin's side!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br>Odin\u2019s Defense is a twist on the traditional Tower Defense genre: instead of upgrades, equip your towers with powerful items to create unique effects each round. Immerse yourself in the story and make choices that will shape the outcome of your campaign. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3021780/extras/e63f4e74ac72a7227ea345e81934cd2d.avif?t=1745393726\" data-has-big width=800 height=139 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hand select the towers you will bring into battle. </strong>Get tactical, pick your favourites and charge into battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3021780/extras/f50ceef9f49e4f0d331ce1d36ec235e4.poster.avif?t=1745393726\" width=672 height=178 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3021780/extras/f50ceef9f49e4f0d331ce1d36ec235e4.webm?t=1745393726\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3021780/extras/f50ceef9f49e4f0d331ce1d36ec235e4.mp4?t=1745393726\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3021780/extras/9ec87a2033ecd0cbc62749052b1ebdc1.avif?t=1745393726\" data-has-big width=800 height=139 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Spindlewood, Dunes Eternal and the Boolevard of Broken Bones await the arrival of the Bifrost!</strong> Journey across forests, graveyards, deserts and more on your quest to defeat Fenrir.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3021780/extras/e05b2b9c1624ddf880bef68d09ed1070.poster.avif?t=1745393726\" width=672 height=178 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3021780/extras/e05b2b9c1624ddf880bef68d09ed1070.webm?t=1745393726\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3021780/extras/e05b2b9c1624ddf880bef68d09ed1070.mp4?t=1745393726\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3021780/extras/360cce6115b75e7796a4541e9de71273.avif?t=1745393726\" data-has-big width=800 height=139 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Equip your towers with powerful artefacts for support, power, extra damage and everything in between.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3021780/extras/1bacf67eacc09fde53780516671c1b88.poster.avif?t=1745393726\" width=672 height=178 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3021780/extras/1bacf67eacc09fde53780516671c1b88.webm?t=1745393726\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3021780/extras/1bacf67eacc09fde53780516671c1b88.mp4?t=1745393726\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3021780/extras/fb695536a36c892254df32d7e0f54276.avif?t=1745393726\" data-has-big width=800 height=139 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Destroy hoarde after hoarde of enemies in Odin's name! </strong>From slimes to gravekeepers, from spiders to mummies, there's no shortage of baddies for you to best.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3021780/extras/dbc799a749ee44631015d0f5d37c48f1.poster.avif?t=1745393726\" width=672 height=178 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3021780/extras/dbc799a749ee44631015d0f5d37c48f1.webm?t=1745393726\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3021780/extras/dbc799a749ee44631015d0f5d37c48f1.mp4?t=1745393726\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Single player tower defense inspired by <strong>Norse mythology.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Traverse <strong>3 biomes</strong> on your quest to bind Fenrir. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- <strong>10 available towers</strong> all with unique abilities. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- <strong>Tons of enemies</strong> to challenge your skills and test your wits. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- <strong>12 items</strong> for you to collect and use in creative ways. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- <strong>The Longhouse Codex</strong>: complete in-game lore and game statistics at your fingertips. </p>",
